WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:05.880
So Dark Souls 3 has added a bunch of new
refinements that are really good for the

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:09.980
game but of course they're also really
hidden and you shouldn't have to puzzle

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.429
them out yourself like I did. Let me
tell you about them

00:00:13.429 --> 00:00:17.529
number one is that you can hold down on
the D pad and you'll be brought to the

00:00:17.529 --> 00:00:21.640
first item in your quick select bar. For
most people this will be their healing

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:26.369
estus flask and I recommend you keep it that
way because, man, once you discover this

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:30.570
mechanic you'll no longer be like "Ah where
the fuck is my estus" and die while

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.600
you're toggling for it. It's great
there's no longer a drawback to having

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.200
ten items in your quick select bar.
 For number two everyone knows that fashion

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.629
Souls is far more important than the
worthless stats on your armor. For

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:48.820
example, these gloves have far better
defense, poise and resistances but they

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:53.949
show my skinny hollow elbows and that
just won't do so now the game helps you

00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:58.890
curate the perfect fashion all with the
press of the right analog stick at the

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:03.340
equipment screen. That's better. And at
some point in your journey you gonna

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:08.100
take off that helmet and be like "holy
shit I look like beef jerky". Well don't worry.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.220
In Dark Souls 3 it's almost a
good thing to go hollow, so let me explain.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:18.080
When you rescued a character called
Yoel on the Undead Settlement bridge, you

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:21.659
can bring him back to your shrine and
when you talk to him there, you have the

00:01:21.659 --> 00:01:26.570
option to "draw out your true strength". Selecting this option lets you level

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:31.909
up once for free, but there is a hidden
catch. When you level up for free at Yoel,

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:37.270
you receive a Dark Sigil in the key slot of your inventory and every time you

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.430
die with a Dark Sigil in your inventory,
you receive a point of hollowing in your

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:46.700
Stat screen, visible here. The more
hollowing you get, the more you look like

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:51.509
beef jerky, the darker your covenant
symbol becomes and the more excited

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:56.259
Yoel gets. Every few points of hollowing
just check back at Yoel and he'll let

00:01:56.259 --> 00:01:58.399
you level up again getting you another

00:01:58.399 --> 00:02:02.460
Dark Sigil in your inventory, giving you more
points of hollowing when you die and

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:07.219
again and again until you level up five
times at Yoel and he dies of

00:02:07.219 --> 00:02:09.239
excitement. In his place

00:02:09.239 --> 00:02:10.800
Yuria appears and

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.970
the hollowing quest line continues. I
highly highly recommend that you go down

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:19.580
this quest line because in my opinion
it's one of the best ones in the game

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:24.310
however it is very very tricky to do
right so check out my lore through series

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:28.590
if you're interested in doing the quest
line we're gonna go through it there.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:34.220
If you spent hours curating the perfect waifu -I
wouldn't do that but some people like to

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:39.320
do it it's weird- anyway don't worry it's
easy to reverse hollowing: just buy a

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:44.030
purging stone from Yuria and you can
remove all the hollowing points and

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:48.690
furthermore if you give a fire keeper
soul to the fire keeper then she'll heal the

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:53.640
dark sigils in your inventory so you
won't hollow again. Good looks don't come

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:58.750
cheap though so remember that. Number
four is that it's now way easier to play

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:02.480
with your mates: just set a password
shared between you both and all of a

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:07.520
sudden you will be able to be summoned
regardless of your soul level. To balance

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:12.340
this the game will scale down the Phantoms
strength to match the hosts. Also you

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:17.100
can't drop a weapon for your friend that
exceeds his or her maximum upgraded

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:21.230
weapon. How cool is this summoning
system though. For so long we've been

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:25.200
leveling up characters alongside our
friends and that gets so tricky and

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:30.280
complicated. This simplifies things so
much. But I'll tell you what I like more

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.330
than friends:

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:36.610
invading people. Once you get the red eye
orb from Ringfinger Leonhard, you can use

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.700
it to invade indefinitely. I'll

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:42.709
explain his quest line in another video,
but did you know that the rewards you

00:03:42.709 --> 00:03:47.831
get for killing a host now depend on
which covenant you're in? For example if I

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:52.360
invade with the red eye orb and a sunbro
medal equipped, then I'll get sun

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.670
light medals for killing. If you go in as
a red phantom mound maker I'll get a

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.530
vertebra shackle for killing, and so on

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:03.050
if I invade as anything else I think
though I get a pale tongue, which is a

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:07.040
reward for the fingers of Rosaria
covenant, which is associated with the

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.760
red eye orb. So if you want to farm those
three covenant rewards, then PvP with a

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:14.720
friend or invade others, it's really
good for switching it up.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.330
additionally the color of your red
phantom now changes depending on your

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.020
equipped covenant as well.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:24.190
You can see here I'm this sexy golden red
phantom because I'm a sunbro invader

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:30.160
I love the way it looks. so yeah try some jolly murdering
for once. Another related thing is to do

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:35.010
with invasion requirements: you can only
invade people who match or are below

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:39.720
your maximum upgraded weapon leve,l in
addition to the soul level system also

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:44.850
being in place. A user named Prinex
on Reddit actually did a great write-up on

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:48.340
invasion requirements and you should go
and check it out, it's really interesting.

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:53.039
I'll put it in the description below. Number
six: one thing that I discovered from

00:04:53.039 --> 00:04:57.960
watching PvP streamers was that you can
now parry people even if they attack you

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.590
from behind.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:05.310
Apparently a shield parry now affects
phantoms in a 360 radius around you. But

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:11.060
is this a bug or feature? Time will tell.
For number seven I've written down that

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:15.640
you can perform visceral attacks on a ton of
enemies, some of whom don't even look

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:19.570
staggerable. The head is what you often
want to aim for on many enemy creatures,

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:23.500
but the main thing I wanna talk about is
that if you hit an enemy regularly

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:27.870
during this time, just with a light attack
for example, you will now hear a different

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:31.320
sound which indicates that you're
dealing more damage during their

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.060
vulnerable state.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:38.880
You also hear this sound on counter hits
and all the other vulnerable times, it's

00:05:38.889 --> 00:05:39.950
a nice touch.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:45.150
Number eight: when you run and press R2 now you do a jumping attack. These can also be

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:49.380
initiated by pressing forward and R2 of course. What's also new is that you

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:53.780
can do a rolling attack animation
immediately after the jumping attack. I

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:57.240
found for most weapons this is really
good for Crystal lizards because jumping

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:01.490
attacks often fling them onto their back
and rolling attacks are often vertical

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:06.590
or pokes. Number nine: when you do a
jump by pressing L3 when you're

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:10.610
running, you no longer have to do the
mandatory roll at the end of it. If you

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:14.669
stop pressing forward on the left analog
stick as soon as you initiate the jump,

00:06:14.669 --> 00:06:18.150
then your character will come to a
standstill, like this. This is

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:22.590
particularly good for tricky jumping
puzzles like this one, but there really

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:26.870
aren't many uses for this right now at
all, which is a shame. I never thought

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.020
Dark Souls needed jumping puzzles because
the jumping mechanic has always been

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:34.080
trash, but the fact that this exists,
that you don't have to roll is almost

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:38.130
like an Easter egg. It would be interesting
if they put a puzzle where you have to

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:41.930
stop the jump, you can't do the roll in
order to get the reward. I think that

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:47.479
would be neat. Alright number ten: using weapon arts with no focus still works for

00:06:47.479 --> 00:06:51.640
a lot of weapons and while their
effectiveness is often reduced, some

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:55.960
weapons are worth using simply for their
weapon art. For example the sunlight

00:06:55.960 --> 00:07:00.180
straight sword has a buff that you can
apply even with tiny bit of focus and

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:04.729
daggers have a quick step that functions
with no focus at all. This is

00:07:04.729 --> 00:07:09.910
particularly handy when you're rolling
through the swamp: just equip a dagger and fly

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:13.690
through the swamp with the weapon art
instead. Look at how much faster this is.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:17.870
It brought my swamp experience up to a
almost bearable,

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:22.450
it's pretty good. The next five secrets are
little quickfire secrets. First, you can

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:26.600
do a charge attack by holding R2 like in
Bloodborne. You can also throw some

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:31.139
knives while running and some spells
like Farron Dart while running as well

00:07:31.139 --> 00:07:36.330
you get a heavy roll at above 70%
equip burden so it's very beneficial

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:42.010
to stay below 70 percent. Power stance
dual wielding no longer exists in Dark

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:45.290
Souls 3 which is sad, because I think
that was one of the best things that

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:49.840
Dark Souls 2 brought to the table. You
can now two-hand dual wieldable weapons

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:54.510
instead. And for number fifteen I want
you to go and check out this video. It's

00:07:54.510 --> 00:08:00.050
by a streamer named Scott Jund who did an
awesome little write-up on how defense works

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:04.770
in Dark Souls 3. My favorite discovery in that
video was that having an empty armor slot

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:09.850
is something you just never want to do,
and that even wearing rags in that armor slot

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:15.310
can drastically increase your defense. So
subscribe if you want to. This channel is

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:19.510
all about Dark Souls so we got stories and
tips and guides, and if you have any

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:22.950
other tips, throw them in the comments
section. It's really fun to be able to

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:25.940
unpack the game with you guys and I'm
sure there's some stuff I've missed and

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.650
I hope there is, because I don't want
this to end.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.390
Also if you have another browser tab
free, open up rbfrosty's

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:35.880
twitch stream and throw him a follow, because
he helped a ton with all the

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.900
multiplayer testing, and he is another
great streamer in the community that you

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:44.220
should support. Thanks for watching and
supporting me and I'll see you in the next one

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:45.270
for more Dark Souls 3.

